# LearnKit reproducible benchmark artifact — committed on purpose so
# `python -m benchmarks.make_results` works on a fresh clone (offline).
# Order matters: re-include the results dir, re-ignore its contents, then
# whitelist ONLY the pinned raw runs that back the published matrix.
!benchmarks/matrix_manifest.json
!benchmarks/RESULTS.json
!benchmarks/results/
benchmarks/results/*
!benchmarks/results/agentic_suite_qwen2.5-14b_20260621_104149_summary.json
!benchmarks/results/agentic_suite_qwen2.5-32b_20260621_103650_summary.json
!benchmarks/results/agentic_suite_llama-3.3-70b_20260627_185537_summary.json
